# =============================================================================
# Unreal Engine 5 project .gitignore
# Engine-generated/intermediate files must stay out of source control — see
# CLAUDE.md §10 ("DerivedDataCache/, Intermediate/, and Saved/ are engine-
# generated and must stay gitignored"). Everything below either regenerates
# from the .uproject + Source/ + Content/, or is machine/user-specific.
# =============================================================================

# --- Engine-generated build/intermediate folders -----------------------------
# The `/` with no leading `/` matches at any depth, so this also covers
# per-plugin folders such as Plugins/SomePlugin/Binaries/, Intermediate/, etc.
Binaries/
Build/
DerivedDataCache/
Intermediate/
Saved/

# --- Project files regenerated by "Generate Visual Studio project files" -----
# (right-click the .uproject, or Unreal Build Tool). Never hand-edit these,
# never commit them — a stale committed one silently drifts from Source/.
*.sln
*.slnx
*.suo
*.sdf
*.opensdf
*.VC.db
*.VC.opendb
*.xcodeproj
*.xcworkspace

# --- IDE/editor local state ---------------------------------------------------
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/

# --- Crash reporter / editor local cache --------------------------------------
CrashReportClient/

# --- Packaged build output ----------------------------------------------------
# Where a local "Package Project" run lands if pointed inside the repo
# (per CLAUDE.md §3.1 we ship a Development build as a shared file, not via
# git) — ignore it so a packaged .exe/.pak never gets committed by accident.
Packaged/

# --- OS filesystem noise -------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# --- Misc ------------------------------------------------------------------
*.log
*.tmp
*.bak
